{"id":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch10-weak-maximum-principles#thm:chow-ii-scalar-wmp","title":"thm:chow-ii-scalar-wmp","path":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch10-weak-maximum-principles.md","line":29,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch10-weak-maximum-principles.tex#thm:chow-ii-scalar-wmp","uses":["[[references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch10-weak-maximum-principles#def:chow-ii-semilinear-heat-operator]]","[[references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch10-weak-maximum-principles#thm:chow-ii-scalar-comparison]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch10-weak-maximum-principles.tex","label":"thm:chow-ii-scalar-wmp","line":49,"source":"\\begin{theorem}[scalar weak maximum principle]\n\\label{thm:chow-ii-scalar-wmp}\n\\source{chow-et-al-ricci-flow-part-ii:page-0030}\n\\uses{def:chow-ii-semilinear-heat-operator, thm:chow-ii-scalar-comparison}\n\\dcref{ch10:10.2}\n\\group{Scalar maximum principles}\n\n\nIf $Lu\\le0$ and $u(\\cdot,0)\\le c$, then, while the solution $\\phi$ of\n\\(\\phi'=F(\\phi,t),\\ \\phi(0)=c\\) exists, one has $u(x,t)\\le\\phi(t)$.\n\\end{theorem}\n\\begin{proof}\n\\sketch\n\\uses{thm:chow-ii-scalar-comparison}\nThe function $v(x,t)=\\phi(t)$ satisfies $Lv=0$ and $u(\\cdot,0)\\le v(\\cdot,0)$.\nApply the comparison theorem.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Theorem</div></section>[scalar weak maximum principle] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-74686d3a63686f772d69692d7363616c61722d776d70\"></span> <span class=\"tex-source\" style=\"display:block\">Source: <span class=\"reference\">chow-et-al-ricci-flow-part-ii:page-0030</span></span> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FChowEtAl%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fch10-weak-maximum-principles%23def%3Achow-ii-semilinear-heat-op